; Fix HD Inventory Icon Position -- weight rounding in item tooltips.
;
; Promotes utils_ui.script's file-local `stats_round_idp` out of file scope so
; zzz_aaa_weight_rounding_fix.script can wrap it. See that file for why.
;
; The engine (CScriptStorage::do_file, script_storage.cpp) rewrites matching
; `^local` declarations before compiling the script, so only column-0 file-scope
; declarations qualify. `local stats_round_idp = ui_inventory.stats_round_idp`
; sits at column 0 in both the HD framework's copy of utils_ui.script and
; Sota's, so this lands whichever one wins the load order.
;
; Unlocalizing REQUIRES modded EXEs (demonized / SSS / GAMMA). GAMMA ships them.
; Without them this file is inert and the fix script detects that and no-ops.
;
; Kept separate from unlocalizer_fix_hd_icon_pos.ltx so that file stays byte
; identical to the copy mod 464 ships. Sections merge across every file in this
; folder, so adding one here cannot clash with another mod's.

[utils_ui]
stats_round_idp
